!how/campaigns/campaign_haussmann/artifacts/p4_1/captures_outage_20260823/state-of-the-network__desktop__dark.png

# Scratch capture output (Class 3 — no citation)
/visual_capture_out/

# ISS gate-receiver runtime state (HAUSSMANN wind-down 2026-08-21). The receiver writes a
# PID lock and a port sidecar into how/gates/ while it is listening; both are ephemeral
# process state, not vault content, and no such file has ever been tracked. The `.pending`
# sentinels ARE tracked — they record that a gate awaits an operator decision.
how/gates/.gate_receiver.*

# GRANDE REVUE evidence estate (2026-09-02, GR-4's ⛩ close-cascade rider — operator-ruled in).
# Ratified Refit policy in its DANGLE-SAFE ORDER: the CITED frames are committed FIRST (above,
# same commit), THEN the uncited are ignored — ignoring first can strand a cited file.
# Derived, not typed: 67 untracked = 20 cited + 47 uncited. ⚠ The figure this campaign carried
